{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-021.md","record_count":50,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"யாரது? யாரோ வந்த மாதிரி இருந்ததே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":35,"printed_page":34}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சமரசம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...விட்டுடுவேனா! ஒன் மேலே எவ்வளவு பிரியம் எனக்கு—ஓடப் பாக்கிறியே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னப்பா விஷயம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலைக்காரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒண்ணுமில்லேம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சமையல்காரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய், சும்மா இரு. இப்ப அய்யா, அந்த பொண்ணுக்கூடவேல்லே சுத்திக்கிட்டு திரியிராரு...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! நீயும் பாத்துட்டியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என் கண்ணாலே பாத்தோம்மான்னா, அது இன்னைக்கு நேத்தா நடக்குது? அது எவ்வளவு நாளா நடக்குது...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சும்மா சொல்றான்க. ஒண்ணுமில்லேம்மா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய், நீ சும்மா இரு. நீ அய்யா ஆளுல்ல, அவன் நேரே பாத்தவன் சொல்றான்! ஊகூம்...அப்படியா சேதி! சரி, சரி, ஒங்க வேலையைப் போய்ப் பாருங்க...ஏண்டா நீ நிக்கிறே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரொம்ப நாளா இல்லீங்க. இன்னைக்குத்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...இன்னைக்கிதானா? வரட்டும் பேசிக்கிறேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம். வாங்க சார்! வாங்க...வாங்க...இப்படி உட்காருங்க, விளையாட்டெல்லாம் முடிஞ்சாச்சா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அட கொஞ்சம் சும்மா இரு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! அதுக்குள்ளே போயிடுச்சேன்னா கவலையாக்கும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பின்னே இருக்காதா, விளையாடிட்டு இருக்கும் போதே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம், ஆமாம்! பாதியிலே போயிட்டா கவலையாத்தானே இருக்கும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ பாத்தியா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம், அந்தக் கண்றாவியை நான் பாத்துக்கிட்டுதானே இருந்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்றாவியா? அடச்சீ கழுதை! ஓடிப் போயிடுச்சே அது ரொம்ப அழகு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஊஹூம்...அப்ப இருக்கிறது மட்டமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"மட்டம்னு சொல்லலியே! அது மாதிரி இல்லே! ஆஹா, ஓடிப் போயிடுச்சே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":36,"printed_page":35}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்ய! நான் வேணும்னு போயி வரச் சொல்லட்டுமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வரச் சொல்லட்டுமா...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓய்! உம்ம புத்தி வரவர ரொம்ப மட்டமா போவுது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா...இந்தா...என்ன இன்னைக்கு நீ சேஞ்சாயிட்டே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அங்க சேஞ்சாயிடுச்சில்ல. இனி இங்கயும் சேஞ்சாக வேண்டியதுதானே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இந்தா! என்ன நீ ஓன்பாட்ல கடகடான்னு பேசிக்கிட்டே போறே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கடகடான்னு ஒண்ணும் பேசலே; உண்மையைத்தான் சொல்றேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எந்த உண்மையை?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அட, எங்கப்பா பெரிய ஆளுப்பா!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ! நீன்னா சொல்லிட்டே என்னை நீ? உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீயா? எங்கே, இன்னொரு வாட்டி சொல்லு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ...ர...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புருஷனைப் பாத்து நீங்கிறே. எங்கே இன்னொரு தரம் சொல்லு நீ.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீ.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இரு, இந்தா வர்ரேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலைக்காரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எசமான்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கொண்டா இங்கே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ. அது \"சமாதானம் ஓங்குக!\" சமாதானம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எழுதி வாங்கிக்கிட்டு வந்திருக்கேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோகோ, சமாதானம் ஓங்குகவா? சரி, சமாதானம். சாந்தம்மா, சர்தான் வா, இப்படி வா...உட்காரு வந்து.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d046","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...அந்தப் பொறாவை கொண்டாந்து ஒக்கார வச்சுக்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d047","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன எசமான் இது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d048","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதானே புரியலே. நான் ஒலக சமாதானத்துக்கு புறா வாங்கிக்கிட்டு வந்தா, அது ஊட்டுச் சண்டையை வளர்த்\nதுடுச்சே. உம்...சரி, அதைக் கொண்டுபோய் அங்கே மாட்டு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36},{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"page_segments":[{"pdf_page":37,"printed_page":36,"text":"அதானே புரியலே. நான் ஒலக சமாதானத்துக்கு புறா வாங்கிக்கிட்டு வந்தா, அது ஊட்டுச் சண்டையை வளர்த்"},{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37,"text":"துடுச்சே. உம்...சரி, அதைக் கொண்டுபோய் அங்கே மாட்டு."}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d049","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்ப இதை இப்படி திருப்பி மாட்டிட்டான்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s021-d050","scene_id":"raja-rani-s021","scene_ordinal":21,"transition_audit_id":"T021","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன? \"சண்டை ஓங்குஹ.\" சண்டை ஓங்குஹவா? ஆ...நீ ஏழுதினியா? அழிடா, அழி, அழி, அழி.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":38,"printed_page":37}],"source_scene_file":"scene-021.md"}]}